SOLUTION 0 Inflow
    pH 7.0
    Na 1.0
    Cl 1.0
SOLUTION 1-10 Initial
    pH 7.0
    Ca 1.0
    Cl 2.0
EXCHANGE 1-10
    X 0.001
    -equilibrate 1
TRANSPORT
    -cells 10
    -shifts 10
    -flow_direction forward
    -boundary_conditions flux flux
    -print_cells 4
    -print_frequency 10
END
